SOLANO (30s, green silk, fan) fans herself by the window.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "TOBY GREER (teens, newsboy cap) hovers by the door with a bundle of papers.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "SHERIFF ABNER WOODS (50s, star, shotgun) leans on the counter.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "MRS. PRUDENCE COLE (40s, gloves, hatbox) sits primly on the bench.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Train... delayed... bandits... Red Rock.", "name": "TELEGRAPH", "speaker": 6, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": ["clicking, then spoken by Ezekiel as he decodes"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Train's delayed.", "name": "EZEKIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Delayed! By whom?", "name": "BLAKELY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Colonel, please. The heat.", "name": "SOLANO", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Bandits at Red Rock, Colonel.", "name": "WOODS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Red Rock! That's ten miles!", "name": "TOBY", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Young man, lower your voice.", "name": "COLE", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I demand a horse.", "name": "BLAKELY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody's riding anywhere.", "name": "WOODS", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sheriff, my trunk is on that train.", "name": "SOLANO", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "More coming. Wait.", "name": "EZEKIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "The key chatters.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Everyone leans in.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hostages... demand... ransom.", "name": "TELEGRAPH", "speaker": 6, "ext": ["V.O."], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Cole opens her hatbox.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Inside, a derringer.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gentlemen. Madame. I believe I'll be going to Red Rock.", "name": "COLE", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Woods tips his hat.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Blakely sputters.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Solano stops fanning.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Toby whistles low.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ma'am?", "name": "EZEKIEL", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["stunned"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My husband is on that train.", "name": "COLE", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}]}